  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fighting anemia with medical care to 480 children</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will provide medical care for 480 children under five suffering from anemia. As well, we look forward to giving the children the necessary capacities to learn at an average rate, so they won&apos;t be left behind in these matters. With the donations, we will work in the district of Santa Rosa, Lima-Peru, to improve both their health and learning capabilities by providing close support and control, food supplements, and training their parents to implement iron-based diets at a low cost.</narrative>
  </description>
